---
title: "UDP Real-Time Parameter Flow (fire-and-forget)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant UDP as UDP 9882
    participant RS as Remote Script
    participant REG as _registry
    participant H as Handler
    participant LOM as Live Object Model

    MCP->>UDP: send_udp_command("set_device_parameter", params)
    Note over MCP: No response expected<br/>(fire-and-forget)

    UDP->>RS: JSON packet
    activate RS
    RS->>RS: _process_udp_command()<br/>cmd in _UDP_COMMANDS?

    RS->>RS: schedule_message(0, task)<br/>→ queued for main thread
    deactivate RS

    Note over RS: Main thread picks up task

    activate RS
    RS->>REG: dispatch("set_device_parameter", song, params, ctrl)
    REG->>H: set_device_parameter(song, ...)
    H->>LOM: param.value = value
    deactivate RS

    Note over RS: Errors logged, not returned<br/>No response sent to caller
